DEFENSIVE IP SYSTEM - QUICK REFERENCE
======================================

Purpose: Create defensive prior art through public disclosure to prevent patent trolls
Cost: $0 (no attorney fees, no filing fees)
Protection: Prevents others from patenting your disclosed inventions

DIRECTORY STRUCTURE
-------------------
defensive-ip/
├── README.md              # Full system documentation
├── QUICK_START.md         # 10-minute setup guide
├── TEMPLATE_DISCLOSURE.md # Copy this for new disclosures
├── INDEX.md               # Track all disclosures
├── LEGAL_DISCLAIMER.md    # Important legal notices
├── new_disclosure.sh      # Create new disclosure
├── add_hashes.sh          # Add crypto hashes after commit
└── INV-XXXX_NAME/
    └── INV-XXXX_DISCLOSURE.md

PUBLISHED DISCLOSURES
---------------------
1. INV-0001: TRIG6 Risk Geometry Engine (2026-01-25)
   - 931 lines of technical detail
   - 3 detailed example embodiments
   - Implementations in Python, Rust, JavaScript
   - Cryptographically timestamped

QUICK START
-----------
1. Create disclosure:
   ./defensive-ip/new_disclosure.sh INV-0002 "Your Invention"

2. Edit the file with technical details

3. Commit:
   git add defensive-ip/INV-0002_*/
   git commit -m "INV-0002: Initial disclosure"

4. Add hashes:
   ./defensive-ip/add_hashes.sh INV-0002
   git add defensive-ip/INV-0002_*/*.md
   git commit -m "INV-0002: Add hashes"

5. Push:
   git push origin main

